WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:21.937
"Why are you here?" asked Zippy.

2
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:24.242
"This is a racetrack.

3
00:00:24.243 --> 00:00:34.556
It's for speedy cars!"

4
00:00:34.557 --> 00:00:37.643
"I'm going to practice," said Eddy.

5
00:00:37.644 --> 00:00:41.043
"Practice what?" asked Zippy.

6
00:00:41.044 --> 00:00:44.894
"Racing," said Eddy.

7
00:00:44.895 --> 00:00:47.616
Zippy laughed.

8
00:00:47.617 --> 00:00:49.558
"I'm fast!

9
00:00:49.559 --> 00:00:53.466
I don't need to practice!"

10
00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:58.505
Eddy sighed.

11
00:00:58.506 --> 00:01:04.062
Then he zoomed down the track.

12
00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:07.333
"Let's race!" said Zippy.

13
00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:09.442
"I'm going to win!"

14
00:01:09.443 --> 00:01:26.719
Zippy shot after Eddy.

15
00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:29.639
The sky grew dark.

16
00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:34.796
Raindrops splashed everywhere.

17
00:01:34.797 --> 00:01:38.130
Eddy's tires slipped in a puddle.

18
00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:40.892
Eddy slowed down.

19
00:01:40.893 --> 00:01:43.565
But Zippy went faster.

20
00:01:43.566 --> 00:01:55.091
Water sprayed off Zippy's tires.

21
00:01:55.092 --> 00:02:00.254
"Hey, Zippy!" Eddy yelled.

22
00:02:00.255 --> 00:02:06.446
"You need to slow—" Crack!

23
00:02:06.447 --> 00:02:09.134
Lightning struck a big tree.

24
00:02:09.135 --> 00:02:13.096
The tree fell onto the racetrack.

25
00:02:13.097 --> 00:02:19.879
"Slow down, Zippy!" cried Eddy.

26
00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:27.488
"You're going to crash!"
